      tags: ["mv01", "mv09"],
      stem: "已知随机向量 $(\\xi,\\eta)$ 的联合密度为 $f(x,y)=\\frac12\\cdot I_{\\{0\\le x\\le1,\\ 0\\le y\\le2\\}}$，求 $P\\bigl(\\{\\xi>\\frac12\\}\\cup\\{\\eta>\\frac12\\}\\bigr)$．",
      answer: "由密度知 $\\xi\\sim U(0,1)$、$\\eta\\sim U(0,2)$ 且独立，故\n$$P\\Bigl(\\xi\\le\\frac12,\\ \\eta\\le\\frac12\\Bigr)=P\\Bigl(\\xi\\le\\frac12\\Bigr)P\\Bigl(\\eta\\le\\frac12\\Bigr)\n=\\frac{1/2}{1}\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{2}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac18 .$$\n于是\n$$P\\Bigl(\\{\\xi>\\tfrac12\\}\\cup\\{\\eta>\\tfrac12\\}\\Bigr)=1-P\\Bigl(\\xi\\le\\tfrac12,\\eta\\le\\tfrac12\\Bigr)=1-\\frac18=\\frac78 .$$",
